WEBVTT

00:46.440 --> 00:48.080
He may try to surrender.

02:28.440 --> 02:29.800
He was prepared.

02:30.760 --> 02:32.240
Don’t let him get away!

02:35.800 --> 02:37.680
That bitch lied to me.

06:37.000 --> 06:38.200
It’s me!

07:20.240 --> 07:22.400
Let’s get out of here.

07:23.760 --> 07:26.800
He knows these streets. We don’t.

07:27.360 --> 07:30.240
We have him cornered. We’ve got him.

07:43.120 --> 07:45.920
Fucking animal, to shoot a wounded man.

07:46.120 --> 07:47.680
You will be avenged.

08:02.320 --> 08:06.240
What are you trying to do?
Get yourself killed?

08:37.480 --> 08:38.919
Dear Lord.

08:40.799 --> 08:43.120
Vengeance is yours.

08:44.640 --> 08:48.800
My Father. Look upon me.

08:50.240 --> 08:51.880
Vengeance... 

08:54.160 --> 08:55.760
...is yours too.

26:48.400 --> 26:50.120
A beautiful ghost you are

26:52.240 --> 26:53.080
...and free.

29:58.240 --> 30:01.320
Ok, I have my own 10 seconds of patience
left with this guy.

30:03.360 --> 30:08.200
They say this is how he is. We need him.

31:20.680 --> 31:26.360
I think this clown wants us to
run his rum

31:27.560 --> 31:28.600
...into New York.

32:00.000 --> 32:02.080
He knows who we represent?

34:32.560 --> 34:34.000
Piece of shit.

35:05.560 --> 35:09.160
You plan to kill us all.
